  "details": "The standard controls for piloting a drone are fantastic. There might also be another engaging way to pilot the drone, and that's with tilting the controller itself.\n\nThis suggestion is inspired by hand-tilt controls for prefab flying modes I've seen in VRChat many times over. You press trigger to make the drone fly, and tilt your left or right controller in a freeform manner to make the drone fly in a similar way. This free-flying mode can provide amazing shots and be a fun flying experience.",
